719
00:43:20.015 --> 00:43:22.099
I wanted you

720
00:43:22.100 --> 00:43:23.810
to look like Joan of Arc.

721
00:43:27.230 --> 00:43:29.024
When I heard you sing.

722
00:43:29.941 --> 00:43:32.234
